sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant UI as CLI / WSGI
    participant Q as QuoteOrder
    participant Cat as ProductCatalog
    participant Promo as PromotionCatalog
    participant Ship as ShippingRateProvider
    participant Store as QuoteRecorder
    Customer->>UI: quote request
    UI->>Q: execute(request)
    Q->>Cat: get(sku)
    Cat-->>Q: Product
    opt discount code present
        Q->>Promo: find(code)
        Promo-->>Q: Promotion
    end
    Q->>Ship: price_cents(parcel)
    Ship-->>Q: delivery cost
    Q->>Store: save(quote)
    Q-->>UI: QuoteResult
    UI-->>Customer: serialized quote
